      "id": "mixed-formula-text-001",
      "asset": "assets/mixed-formula-text.png",
      "sha256": "1362598c01a26a2380dc2839791f504fd3003accab5f67e9382b44a23b911dd1",
      "annotation": {
        "kind": "document",
        "blocks": [
          { "id": "b01", "kind": "heading", "text": "Abstract" },
          { "id": "b02", "kind": "paragraph", "text": "We present a novel approach to solving the heat equation using Fourier analysis." },
          { "id": "b03", "kind": "paragraph", "text": "The solution can be expressed as:" },
          { "id": "b04", "kind": "formula", "text": "u(x,t)=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}B_n\\sin\\left(\\frac{n\\pi x}{L}\\right)e^{-\\alpha(n\\pi/L)^2t}" },
          { "id": "b05", "kind": "paragraph", "text": "where alpha is the thermal diffusivity and L is the length of the domain." },
          { "id": "b06", "kind": "heading", "text": "Boundary Conditions" },
          { "id": "b07", "kind": "paragraph", "text": "For Dirichlet boundary conditions:" },
          { "id": "b08", "kind": "formula", "text": "u(0,t)=u(L,t)=0" },
          { "id": "b09", "kind": "paragraph", "text": "The coefficients B_n are determined by the initial condition:" },
          { "id": "b10", "kind": "formula", "text": "B_n=\\frac{2}{L}\\int_0^L u(x,0)\\sin\\left(\\frac{n\\pi x}{L}\\right)dx" },
          { "id": "b11", "kind": "heading", "text": "Numerical Results" },
          { "id": "b12", "kind": "paragraph", "text": "We tested with L=1, alpha=0.01, and initial condition u(x,0)=sin(pi x)." },
          { "id": "b13", "kind": "paragraph", "text": "The solution converges to zero as t approaches infinity, as expected." }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
